### ========================================
### VOYAGE — COMPANY
### 1. Rode o bloco de login abaixo primeiro
### 2. O token é capturado automaticamente
### ========================================

@base = https://voyagegabi.onrender.com
@ownerToken = {{loginOwner.response.body.token}}
@companyId = {{createCompany.response.body.id}}


### LOGIN — rode este bloco primeiro
# @name loginOwner
POST {{base}}/user/login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "email":    "teste4@voyage.com",
    "password": "Password@2026"
}

###

### Criando uma Company
# @name createCompany
POST {{base}}/company HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
content-type: application/json

{
    "name":     "Gaby Artesanatos",
    "category": "Outros",
    "cnpj":     "43.870.372/0001-81",
    "evaluate": 4.7,
    "places":   "Rua 10, número 11"
}

###

### Listar todas as companies (autenticado)
GET {{base}}/company HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
content-type: application/json

###

### Listar todas as companies sem estar logado
GET {{base}}/company HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

###

### Listar uma única company
GET {{base}}/company/{{companyId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
content-type: application/json

###

### Filtro por nome
GET {{base}}/company?name=Borella HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

###

### Filtro por endereço
GET {{base}}/company?places=Rua HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

###

### Filtro por categoria
GET {{base}}/company?category=Lanchonete HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

###

### Editar company
PUT {{base}}/company/{{companyId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
content-type: application/json

{
    "name":     "Tabajara Grill",
    "category": "Lanchonete",
    "cnpj":     "61.851.929/0001-00",
    "evaluate": 4.2,
    "places":   "Avenida São Carlos, Centro"
}

###

### Deletar company
### ATENÇÃO: descomente só quando quiser apagar de verdade
# DELETE {{base}}/company/{{companyId}} HTTP/1.1
# Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
# content-type: application/json

###

